{title: Sapna Jahan}
{artist: Sonu Nigam Ajay Atul Brothers}
{key: Cm}

{c: Verse 1}
[Cm] [Gm],        Sapna jahan dastak na de
[Fm] [G#] [D#] [A#],        Chaukhat thi woh akhein meri..
[Cm] [Gm],        baato se thi tadad mein..
[Fm] [G#] [D#],        Khamoshiyaaan zyada meri..
[G] [D#] [F],        Jabse pade tere kadam..
[F] [A#],        Chalne lagi duniya meri..
[Cm] [D#],        Mere dil me jagah Khuda ki khali thi
[F] [G#] [A#],        Dekha wahan pe aaj tera chehra hai..
[Cm] [D#],        Main bhatakta hua sa ek baadal hun..
[F] [G#] [A#],        Jo tere aasmaan pe aake thehra hai?
[Cm] [D#] [F],        Tu rooh hai toh main kaaya banu..
[A#] [D#] [Cm],        Taa-umr main tera saaya banu..
[Cm] [D#] [F],        Keh de toh ban jaun bairaag main..
[A#] [D#] [Cm],        Kehde toh main teri maya banu..
[F] [D#] [F],        Tu saaz hai, main ragini..
[F] [G#] [A#],        Tu raat hai, main chandni..
[Cm] [D#],        Mere dil mein jagah Khuda ki khaali thi
[F] [G#] [A#],        Dekha wahan pe aaj tera chehra hai..
[Cm] [D#],        Main bhatakta hua sa ek baadal hun..
[F] [G#] [A#],        Jo tere aasmaan pe aake thehra hai?
[Cm] [D#] [F],        Hum pe sitaaron ka ehsaan ho..
[A#] [D#] [Cm],        Poora adhoora har armaan ho..
[Cm] [D#] [F],        Ek dusre se jo baandhe humein..
[A#] [D#] [Cm],        Baahon mein nanhi si ik jaan ho..
[F] [D#] [F],        Aabaad ho chota sa ghar..
[F] [G#] [A#],        Lag na sake kisi ke nazar..
[Cm] [D#],        Mere dil mein jagah Khuda ki khaali thi
[F] [G#] [A#],        Dekha wahan pe aaj tera chehra hai
